# TONIC FILL playing: a fill trig retriggers 4 times over its step. Kick on 1 and 5, step 5 has FILL.
# With NOTES OUT, one bar = 1 + 4 notes; at 120 BPM a bar is 2 s, so 3 s is 5 + 5 = 10 notes.
wait 300
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
key w4 down
tapkey b9
key w4 up
expect vfill0.0.4 1
tap GLO   # wip290: 1st press = VEL
tap GLO
tap GLO   # (wip129: the 1st press is the mixer, the 2nd COMP, the 3rd the settings list)
tap GLO
tap GLO   # wip267: ...then MEMORY, then the settings list
turn SELECT 1
turn ALGO 1
tap HOME
tap FX
tap SEQ
expect noteons 0
tap PLAY
wait 3000
tap PLAY
expect noteons 10
# the same without the fill: 1 + 1 per bar, 4 in two bars
key w4 down
tapkey b9
key w4 up
expect vfill0.0.4 0
tap PLAY
wait 3000
tap PLAY
expect noteons 14
# a muted track does not retrigger: mute track 1 (HOME + black key 1), play on: no new notes
key w4 down
tapkey b9
key w4 up
